        "username": "_Mad_Dog",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/_mad_dog/{size}/4859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-09-03T03:11:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So, I got \"Mint\" on my first play, but described this match as a \"self-licking ice cream cone\". So I decided to take this to the ultimate test.</p>\n<p>I played a second game where each turn the heroes passed on playing a card and using a power, and they won (or should I say \"Heroic Infinitor\" won?) at the exact same spot, on Heroic Infinitor's third turn.&nbsp; Now, doing it this way Argent Adept fell on Heroic Infinitor's final turn, and the other heroes were much worse off than in my first game, but it was still a win.</p>\n<p>I'm beginning to remember why I don't care for fights against Infinitor.&nbsp; Not the best match.</p>",
